  ($qb$ITEM-MCQ-5TO10-R7-004$qb$, $qb$A3-05$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$A colleague asks you to take an extra task, but your current deadline is at risk. The trade-off affects more than one commitment and must be sustainable. What is the best response?$qb$, $qb$Explain your workload and agree which task should take priority$qb$, $qb$Offer to help with part of the task after your deadline$qb$, $qb$Accept the task and try to manage both$qb$, $qb$Refuse immediately because your schedule is full$qb$, $qb$Accept it but give it very little attention$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
